    "synopsis": {
        "native": "Tereza ima 37 godina, \u017eivi u Splitu. Nakon nekoliko spontanih poba\u010daja saznaje kako postoji vjerojatnost da genetski nije kompatibilna sa svojim suprugom. Ve\u0107 du\u017ee osje\u0107a pritisak okoline te zapo\u010dne preispitivati svoj rutinirani brak, \u0161to potakne niz doga\u0111aja koji \u0107e joj promijeniti \u017eivot, u duhu novoste\u010dene slobode i istine koja je samo njena.",
        "english": "A 60-year-old Berlin actress is mugged by a young man. She faces the 17-year-old thief again when she, as a teacher, is tasked to help him with a speech impediment. The two grow close during language lessons in her apartment and leave Germany to travel to France together."
